{"Between RUnlock and Lock another goroutine may compute and set the cache, causing duplicated work - should use double-checked locking pattern": 0.7707840800285339, "Write lock is held while doing I/O and network calls (readWebAssetsFromCDN/readWebAssetsFromFile), blocking other callers and hurting concurrency - expensive compute should be done without holding any lock": 0.8535667061805725, "Cache is still stored even when cfg.Env == setting.Dev, which may not be intended behavior if the goal is to avoid caching entirely in dev mode": 0.452436238527298, "Missing comment on the mutex explaining the locking discipline (when RLock vs Lock is used and whether double-check is performed)": 0.15382076799869537}